              "content": "=#Overview\nYou're a helpful, intelligent writing assistant.\n\n##Task\nRewrite the LinkedIn post that I'm going to give you in a way that encapsulates the original theme but uses different words.\n\nI am targeting an audience that are people who build with or want to learn AI. They are always fascinated by new discoveries or news that actually make an impact.\n\n## My Results\nOver the last year I generated 6 figures, worked with 40+ businesses and taught 17k+ people and I got to do a bunch of fun stuff like travel, enjoy my life, etc. \n\n\n#Rules\n- Use a no fluff, young tone when re-writing the LinkedIn post\n- ONLY output the LinkedIn post and that's it\n"
            },
